  "content": "<p><strong>「地獄深淵升級」是一款小型模組，為地獄的熔岩海增添額外的動植物群系。總共新增了九種魚類、一種新附魔與一種藥水，以便探索地獄中的熔岩環境。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>依賴項目</strong></p><p><strong>Geckolib 3.0</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>最新更新加入了數種新魚類與一種可透視熔岩的新型玻璃，讓您能打造所有以熔岩為主題的水族箱 ;)</strong></p><p><strong><img src=\"https://imgur.com/UHJWXOX.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"374\" height=\"200\"><br></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>熔岩釣魚</strong><br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SF98U0S.png\" width=\"366\" height=\"177\"></p><p><strong>本模組新增於熔岩中釣魚的功能（主世界/地獄皆可）</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>新增魚種</strong></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/N6iiT9P.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"264\" height=\"135\"></p><p><strong>靈魂吸取者</strong>：生成於靈魂沙谷，可用於製作精美的靴子</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fae924H.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"195\"></p><p><strong>凋零骨魚</strong>：生成於靈魂沙谷</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Exudvdm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"162\"></p><p><strong>骨魚</strong>：生成於地獄荒原</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oJeUZib.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"202\"></p><p><strong>灼熱鱈魚</strong>：生成於地獄荒原</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hcreNrT.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"266\" height=\"117\"></p><p><strong>熒光鰭魚</strong>：生成於緋紅森林</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sAbvkG2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"143\"></p><p><strong>熔岩河豚</strong>：生成於扭曲森林，可用於釀造新藥水</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0ve2oOl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"180\"></p><p><strong>黑曜石魚</strong>：生成於玄武岩三角洲</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WIV121c.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"212\"></p><p><strong>岩漿立方魚</strong>：生成於玄武岩三角洲</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/njPA4vm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"265\" height=\"190\"></p><p><strong>烈焰魚</strong>：生成於要塞結構中</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>深淵區域還會生成可吸收熔岩的海綿，置入水中會變乾</p><p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/jfTxh71.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"662\" height=\"454\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>深淵中亦會生成噴發口，產出優質礦石<br><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SW1k1tv.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"665\" height=\"482\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><pre>若對模組有建議、錯誤回報或想參與討論，請加入以下Discord伺服器！</pre><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/az7B3Y6UPW\" rel=\"nofollow\">點此加入我們的Discord伺服器！</a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/KB9kRYV.png\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
